ThreeIsland_BondBridge_TideDen_Text_T0Intro::
    .string "The TIDE keeps its distance from\n"
    .string "strangers.$"

ThreeIsland_BondBridge_TideDen_Text_T0Defeat::
    .string "Washed away...$"

ThreeIsland_BondBridge_TideDen_Text_T0Post::
    .string "The water runs deeper ahead.$"

ThreeIsland_BondBridge_TideDen_Text_T1Intro::
    .string "The beast calmed the sea when\n"
    .string "the sky broke. We stay for it.$"

ThreeIsland_BondBridge_TideDen_Text_T1Defeat::
    .string "The tide turns.$"

ThreeIsland_BondBridge_TideDen_Text_T1Post::
    .string "The ORACLE will not be so gentle.$"

ThreeIsland_BondBridge_TideDen_Text_T2Intro::
    .string "You smell of dry land. You do\n"
    .string "not belong in the water's hall.$"

ThreeIsland_BondBridge_TideDen_Text_T2Defeat::
    .string "Dry as ever...$"

ThreeIsland_BondBridge_TideDen_Text_T2Post::
    .string "Almost there. Mind your breath.$"

ThreeIsland_BondBridge_TideDen_Text_T3Intro::
    .string "I am the ORACLE of the TIDE.\n"
    .string "The beast sleeps in my care.\p"
    .string "Prove that your water is worth\n"
    .string "more than my fear.$"

ThreeIsland_BondBridge_TideDen_Text_T3Defeat::
    .string "...Then the tide has chosen you.$"

ThreeIsland_BondBridge_TideDen_Text_T3Post::
    .string "Go. Treat the sea kindly.$"

ThreeIsland_BondBridge_TideDen_Text_GuardsLeft::
    .string "The beast does not stir.\n"
    .string "Its guardians still stand watch.$"
